            "description": {
              "content": "Retrieve a list of contacts for the authenticated user, each containing details such as the contact ID, nickname, contact type, and timestamps.\n- This endpoint allows searching for contacts by nickname or other attributes.\n- The results can be paginated using the limit and offset parameters.",
